{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is near, pick it up. If visible, approach and pick up, check properties, perform task.     list of available nodes: <Condition ID = IsObjectNear    /> <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <Action ID = MoveTowardsObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObjects    />",
